.wrangler/

# macOS iCloud Drive conflict copies ("name 2.ext", "name 3.ext").
# These are not real files; when one appears, diff it against the
# un-suffixed sibling and delete the stale copy. Deliberately NOT
# ignored by a broad " 2.*" glob because that could hide legitimate
# files whose names contain " 2.". Review and remove them manually.
